
@startuml
title Projectory - Portfolio Viewing & Sharing
autonumber

actor Student
actor Visitor
participant "React Frontend" as React
participant "FastAPI Backend" as API
database "PostgreSQL / Supabase" as DB
participant "3D Model Viewer" as Viewer3D

== Generate Shareable Portfolio Link ==

Student -> React: Open My Portfolio
Student -> React: Click Share Portfolio

React -> API: Request shareable portfolio link
API -> API: Verify student authorization

alt Unauthorized student
    API --> React: Return authorization error
    React --> Student: Display error message

else Authorized student
    API -> DB: Retrieve portfolio sharing information
    DB --> API: Return portfolio reference
    API --> React: Return shareable URL
    React --> Student: Display shareable link
end

== Visitor Opens Shared Portfolio ==

Visitor -> React: Open shared portfolio URL
React -> API: Request shared portfolio data
API -> DB: Retrieve portfolio and projects

alt Portfolio unavailable or not shared
    DB --> API: No accessible portfolio
    API --> React: Return not found / access error
    React --> Visitor: Display unavailable message

else Portfolio available
    DB --> API: Return portfolio information
    API --> React: Return public portfolio data

    React --> Visitor: Display personal information,\neducation, skills, experience, projects

    opt Project contains a supported 3D model
        React -> Viewer3D: Load associated model
        Viewer3D --> React: Display interactive model
        React --> Visitor: Show 3D project
    end
end

note over Visitor,DB
  Visitors can view shared portfolio data
  without logging in (R17.2).

  Visitors cannot edit or delete
  portfolio information (R17.5).
end note

@enduml
